00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:06.980
Ouais !!!

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:07.920
Je suis gros !!!

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:08.640
*rire*

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:12.480
Très très grosse ambiance sur la plage.

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:21.140
